   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IRC Somalia 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med insatsen &apos;Bridging the Gap&apos;, &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka tillg&#xe5;ng till sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa och r&#xe4;ttigheter i somaliska lokalsamh&#xe4;llen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of the project &apos;Bridging the Gap&apos;, is to enhance sexual and reproductive health and rights access and justice in Somali communities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, Bridging the Gap: Enhancing SRHR Access and Justice in Somali Communities, has three outcome objectives. 

Outcome 1: Women and girls in fragile contexts have improved awareness of and protection from gender-based violence (GBV) and improved access to sexual and reproductive health and rights services.

Outcome 2: Communities in project target locations embrace gender equality and SRHR rights, leading to reduced harmful gender norms through dialogue and behavior change.

Outcome 3: More resilient and inclusive health system, with sustainable SRHR services for adolescents supported by robust policy frameworks.</narrative>
  </description>
